any_vassal.raw_text:
any_vassal - Iterate through all DIRECT vassals
Optionally specify a vassal stance filter
any_vassal = { vassal_stance = parochial }
any_vassal = { <count=num/all> / <percent=fixed_point> <triggers> }
Supported Scopes: character
Supported Targets: character

every_vassal.raw_text:
every_vassal - Iterate through all DIRECT vassals
Optionally specify a vassal stance filter
any_vassal = { vassal_stance = parochial }
every_vassal = { limit = { <triggers> } <effects> }
Supported Scopes: character
Supported Targets: character

any_vassal_or_below.raw_text:
any_vassal_or_below - Iterate through ALL vassals, not just direct vassals
Optionally specify a vassal stance filter
any_vassal_or_below = { vassal_stance = parochial }
any_vassal_or_below = { <count=num/all> / <percent=fixed_point> <triggers> }
Supported Scopes: character
Supported Targets: character

